  "declared": true,
  "description": "The five-minute predispatch (P5Min) is a MMS system providing projected dispatch for 12 Dispatch cycles (one hour). The 5-minute Predispatch cycle runs every 5-minutes to produce a dispatch and pricing schedule to a 5-minute resolution covering the next hour, a total of twelve periods.\nP5MIN_INTERCONNECTORSOLN sets out the results of the capacity evaluation for Interconnectors, including the calculated limits for the interval.",
